# Tenancy
- Filter every query, job, and inbound integration by a resolved `tenant_id`. No cross-tenant reads or writes.
- Action permission and data scope are separate. Do not infer scope from a role name.
- Cost read does not grant revenue or margin. Authorize on the server. Hiding a button is not a control.
